Subject: [PATCH 12/12] Fix Miner's Delight modid and point Nether's Delight
 tag at its 1.21.1 successor

MD was "miners_delight" but the actual mod id is "minersdelight" -- fixes
every optional cross-mod reference that used it (water_cup, vegan_patty,
bowl_of_stuffed_squid, etc). Also repoints the meal_item tag from the
discontinued "nethersdelight" onto "mynethersdelight", its 1.21.1
continuation.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
